        "id": "be-mysql",
        "title": "MySQL 数据库",
        "level": "进阶",
        "content": "**基础 SQL**\n```sql\n-- 建表\nCREATE TABLE users (\n    id INT PRIMARY KEY AUTO_INCREMENT,\n    name VARCHAR(50) NOT NULL,\n    email VARCHAR(100) UNIQUE,\n    age INT DEFAULT 0,\n    created_at TIMESTAMP DEFAULT CURRENT_TIMESTAMP,\n    INDEX idx_name (name)\n);\n\n-- 增删改查\nINSERT INTO users (name, email) VALUES ('Tom', 'tom@x.com');\nSELECT * FROM users WHERE age > 18 ORDER BY id DESC LIMIT 10;\nUPDATE users SET age = 20 WHERE id = 1;\nDELETE FROM users WHERE id = 1;\n```\n\n**联表查询**\n```sql\n-- INNER JOIN 只返回匹配\nSELECT u.name, o.amount\nFROM users u\nINNER JOIN orders o ON u.id = o.user_id;\n\n-- LEFT JOIN 保留左表全部\n-- RIGHT JOIN 保留右表全部\n```\n\n**聚合与分组**\n```sql\nSELECT department, COUNT(*) cnt, AVG(salary) avg_sal\nFROM employees\nGROUP BY department\nHAVING cnt > 5;\n```\n\n**索引**：\n- 主键索引、唯一索引、普通索引、组合索引\n- 最左前缀原则\n- EXPLAIN 分析执行计划\n- 避免索引失效：函数操作、类型转换、LIKE '%xx'、OR\n\n**事务 ACID**：原子性、一致性、隔离性、持久性。\n**隔离级别**：读未提交、读已提交、可重复读（MySQL 默认）、串行化。\n\n**锁**：共享锁、排他锁、行锁、表锁、间隙锁。\n**优化**：避免 SELECT *、合理索引、分页优化、读写分离、分库分表。",
        "example": "-- MySQL 查询实例\n\nCREATE TABLE users (\n  id INT AUTO_INCREMENT PRIMARY KEY,\n  name VARCHAR(50) NOT NULL,\n  email VARCHAR(100) UNIQUE,\n  dept_id INT,\n  created_at TIMESTAMP DEFAULT CURRENT_TIMESTAMP,\n  INDEX idx_name (name)\n);\n\n-- 多表 JOIN 查询\nSELECT u.name, d.dept_name, COUNT(o.id) AS order_count\nFROM users u\nLEFT JOIN departments d ON u.dept_id = d.id\nLEFT JOIN orders o ON u.id = o.user_id\nWHERE u.created_at > '2025-01-01'\nGROUP BY u.id, u.name, d.dept_name\nHAVING order_count > 5\nORDER BY order_count DESC\nLIMIT 10;\n\n-- 查看执行计划\nEXPLAIN SELECT * FROM users WHERE email = 'tom@test.com';"
